# Off-site credentials for backup-cn.py. Copy to `webdav.env` next to the script
# and run: chmod 600 webdav.env
# The real file is gitignored and must never be committed or echoed.

# Jianguoyun (坚果云): WEBDAV_USERNAME is the login email; WEBDAV_PASSWORD is an
# app password created under 账户信息 -> 安全选项 -> 第三方应用管理 -> 添加应用密码,
# not the account password. Either value containing a double quote is not
# supported by the netrc line this script writes.
WEBDAV_USERNAME=
WEBDAV_PASSWORD=
